      en: ["Population: approximately 12,000 (2015)", "Elevation: 300 m", "Area of Bobonaro district: 1,378 km²", "Distance to Indonesian border: 15 km", "Number of health posts: 3", "Establishment of St. Anthony parish: 1965"],
