      en: ["Located at the foot of Monte Mundo Perdido, a major nature conservation area.", "Known for its significant Catholic mission and historic educational institutions.", "A hub for the production of highland coffee and mountain vegetables.", "Monte Mundo Perdido is home to over 60 distinct species of orchids.", "A crucial transportation link between Baucau in the north and Viqueque in the south.", "Average annual temperatures are significantly lower than in coastal regions."],
