      en: ["A key agricultural center located in southern Manufahi.", "The region is designated as a potential site for onshore oil and gas extraction.", "Renowned for the large-scale cultivation of tobacco and peanuts.", "Positioned on the lower reaches of several rivers flowing into the Timor Sea.", "Characterized by an expansive savanna landscape unique to the south coast.", "The local population includes a significant number of migrants from the highlands."],
